Subject: [PATCH] meson: keep Intel feature option outside active BMC option
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [downstream option ordering]

The shared fwupd patch inserts a new option inside the next option() call
on this source revision. Move it before the active BMC option.

diff --git a/meson.options b/meson.options
--- a/meson.options
+++ b/meson.options
@@ -94,9 +94,10 @@
 # Variables
-option(
 option('fwupd-intel-features', type: 'feature', value: 'disabled',
     description: 'Enable the Intel platforms.')
+
+option(
     'active-bmc-max-allowed',
     type: 'integer',
     value: 1,
     description: 'The maximum allowed active BMC versions.',
 )
